//! One Clifford patch split into exact curved triangular patches.
//!
//! The movable center always remains on the authored patch: it is a point in
//! the patch's parameter domain, never an independently fitted 3D handle.
//! Restricting the homogeneous numerator and weight fields to each of the four
//! surrounding triangles produces exact quadratic triangular patches. Their
//! shared curves and tangent planes therefore agree by construction; the
//! optional wireframe is only a temporary mesh used to display them.

